# Keep published semantic decoders and the oracle regression reference portable.
# Trials, archives, legacy unselected h_Z models, encoder checkpoints and temporary files stay local.
models/**
!models/talent/
!models/talent/*/
!models/talent/*/g-independent/
!models/talent/*/g-autoregressive/
